<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean meal major sales activity in the week ended Aug 22 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1995/96		 1996/97</p>
<p> Australia     20,100		Philippines 76,000</p>
<p> Algeria	 15,000		El Salvador 19,000</p>
<p> Canada	   9,900</p>
<p> Egypt	    7,900</p>
<p>Note: weekly exports of 28,500 tonnes were 60 percent less than the previous week and about 66 percent below the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary destinations: Canada, Venezuela and Egypt.</p>
</text>
